{
  "version": 1,
  "id": 37,
  "name": {
    "ja": "極道脅迫！体育部員たちの逆襲",
    "en": "Yakuza Blackmail! The Sports Club Members' Counterattack",
  },
  "definition": {
    "type": "KILL_LEVEL",
    "level": 25,
    "monster": 1342,
    "maxNum": 1,
    "flags": ["PRESET", "ONCE"],
  },
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "when": {
        "statusAtMost": "COMPLETED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "試合を終えて家路へ向かうサッカー部員達。",
          "疲れからか、不幸にも黒塗りの高級車に追突してしまう。",
          "後輩をかばいすべての責任を負ったあなたに対し、",
          "車の主、暴力団員谷岡が言い渡した示談の条件とは・・・",
        ],
        "en": [
          "After the game, the soccer club members headed home. Perhaps due to exhaustion,",
          "they unfortunately rear-ended a black luxury car.",
          "Taking full responsibility to protect your junior,",
          "what settlement terms did the car's owner, yakuza member Tanioka,",
          "impose on you...?",
        ],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "REWARDED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": ["忘れるな。下北沢暴力団員殺害事件。"],
        "en": ["Don't forget. The Shimokitazawa Yakuza Member Murder Case"],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "FAILED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": ["この淫夢はあなたには難しかったようですね。"],
        "en": ["It seems like this INM was too difficult for you."],
      },
    },
  ],
